                            Preamble / 序言

  The GNU Affero General Public License is a free, copyleft license for
software and other kinds of works, specifically designed to ensure
cooperation with the community in the case of network server software.

 GNU Affero 通用公共许可证是一份自由、著佐权（copyleft）许可证，
适用于软件及其他类型的作品，其特别设计旨在确保网络服务器软件场景下
与社区的合作。

  The licenses for most software and other practical works are designed
to take away your freedom to share and change the works.  By contrast,
our General Public Licenses are intended to guarantee your freedom to
share and change all versions of a program--to make sure it remains free
software for all its users.

 大多数软件和其他实用作品的许可证旨在剥夺你分享和修改作品
的自由。相比之下，我们的通用公共许可证旨在保障你分享和修改
程序所有版本的自由——确保程序对所有用户始终是自由软件。

  When we speak of free software, we are referring to freedom, not
price.  Our General Public Licenses are designed to make sure that you
have the freedom to distribute copies of free software (and charge for
them if you wish), that you receive source code or can get it if you
want it, that you can change the software or use pieces of it in new
free programs, and that you know you can do these things.

 我们所说的"自由软件"，指的是自由，而非价格。我们的通用
公共许可证旨在确保你有以下自由：分发自由软件副本的自由
（如果你愿意，可以为此收费）；获取或能够获取源代码；
修改软件或将其片段用于新的自由程序；并且你知道你可以
做这些事情。

  Developers that use our General Public Licenses protect your rights
with two steps: (1) assert copyright on the software, and (2) offer
you this License which gives you legal permission to copy, distribute
and/or modify the software.

 使用我们通用公共许可证的开发者通过两个步骤保护你的权利：
（1）声明软件的著作权，（2）向你提供本许可证，给予你复制、
分发和/或修改软件的合法许可。

  A secondary benefit of defending all users' freedom is that
improvements made in alternate versions of the program, if they
receive widespread use, become available for other developers to
incorporate.  Many developers of free software are heartened and
encouraged by the resulting cooperation.

 保护所有用户自由的附带好处是：程序的替代版本中的改进，
如果被广泛使用，其他开发者也可以将其纳入自己的版本。
许多自由软件的开发者由此产生的合作感到鼓舞。

  However, in the case of software used on network servers, this
result may fail to come about.  The GNU General Public License
permits making a modified version and letting the public access it
on a server without ever releasing its source code to the public.

 然而，对于运行在网络服务器上的软件，这种合作可能无法
实现。GNU 通用公共许可证允许制作修改版，并让公众通过
服务器访问它，而无需向公众发布其源代码。

  The GNU Affero General Public License is designed specifically to
ensure that, in such cases, the modified source code becomes
available to the community.  It requires the operator of a network
server to provide the source code of the modified version running
there to the users of that server.  Therefore, public use of a
modified version, on a publicly accessible server, gives the public
access to the source code of the modified version.

 GNU Affero 通用公共许可证专门设计来确保在这种情况下，
修改后的源代码能够提供给社区。它要求网络服务器的运营者
向该服务器的用户提供运行在服务器上的修改版的源代码。
因此，在可公开访问的服务器上公开使用修改版，就给予了
公众获取修改版源代码的权利。

  An older license, called the Affero General Public License and
published by Affero, was designed to accomplish similar goals.  This is
a different license, not a version of the Affero GPL, but Affero has
released a new version of the Affero GPL which permits relicensing under
this license.

 一份较早的许可证——由 Affero 发布的 Affero 通用公共许可证——
旨在实现类似目标。本许可证是不同的许可证，不是 Affero GPL 的
某个版本，但 Affero 已发布了允许在本许可证下重新授权的新版本
Affero GPL。

  The precise terms and conditions for copying, distribution and
modification follow.
 复制、分发和修改的精确条款和条件如下。


